{
    "name": {
        "ara": "الصَّبُّ لَهُ يَحْلُو الوَلَهُ",
        "en": "Al-Ṣabbu Lahu Yaḥlu l-Walahu - The Lover Finds Sweetness in Longing"
    },
    "verses": {
        "ara": [
            "الصَّبُّ لَهُ يَحْلُو الوَلَهُ",
            "فِي مَنْ بِهَوَاهُ أَشْغَلَهُ",

            "فَاعْذُرْ مَنْ هَامَ بِسَلْوَاهُ",
            "وَجْدًا وَاحْذَرْ أَنْ تَعْذُلَهُ",

            "وَحَبِيبِي لَيْسَ يَغِيبُ وَلَا",
            "يَرْضَى إِلَّا أَنْ أَسْأَلَهُ",

            "لَمْ أَنْسَ أُخَيَّ تَعَطُّفَهُ",
            "وَتَلَطُّفَهُ وَتَفَضُّلَهُ",

            "وَأَنَا المَشْغُوفُ بِطَلْعَتِهِ",
            "إِذْ صَيَّرَ قَلْبِي مَنْزِلَهُ",

            "وَحِّدْهُ مَعَ التَّنْزِيهِ وَدَعْ",
            "مَنْ شَبَّهَهُ أَوْ مَثَّلَهُ",

            "أَيَخِيبُ نَزِيلٌ أَمَّلَهُ",
            "بِرَسُولِ اللهِ تَوَسُّلُهُ",

            "مِنْ عَهْدِ \"أَلَسْتُ\" تَعَارُفُنَا",
            "وَأَعُوذُ بِهِ أَنْ أَجْهَلَهُ"
        ],
        "en": [
            "Al-ṣabbu lahu yaḥlu l-walahu",
            "Fī man bi-hawāhu ashghalahu",

            "Fa-ʿdhur man hāma bi-salwāhu",
            "Wajdan wa-ḥdhar an taʿdhulahu",

            "Wa-ḥabībī laysa yaghību wa-lā",
            "Yarḍā illā an asʾalahu",

            "Lam ansa ukhayya taʿaṭṭufahu",
            "Wa-talaṭṭufahu wa-tafaḍḍulahu",

            "Wa-ana l-mashghūfu bi-ṭalʿatihi",
            "Idh ṣayyara qalbī manzilahu",

            "Waḥḥidʹhu maʿa l-tanzīhi wa-daʿ",
            "Man shabbahahu aw maththalahu",

            "A-yakhību nazīlun ammalahu",
            "Bi-rasūli llāhi tawassuluhu",

            "Min ʿahdi \"a-lastu\" taʿārufunā",
            "Wa-aʿūdhu bihi an ajhalahu"
        ]
    },
    "translation": {
        "en": [
            "The lover finds sweetness in longing",
            "for the one whose love has wholly consumed him",

            "Have mercy on one lost in his solace, overcome with yearning",
            "beware of blaming him.",

            "My Beloved never absents Himself,",
            "Nor is He pleased unless I seek Him",

            "I have not forgotten His tender mercy,",
            "His gentle care, and His boundless grace.",

            "I am captivated by His radiant beauty,",
            "For He has made my heart His dwelling.",

            "Affirm His oneness with complete transcendence,",
            "And shun all likeness or resemblance.",

            "Can one who entrusts their hope to Him ever falter,",
            "while seeking through the intercession of God’s Messenger?",

            "Since the covenant of \"Am I not (your Lord)?\" we have known Him,",
            "And I seek refuge in Him from ever being ignorant of Him"
        ]
    },
